### 3. Skrip Database Lengkap Khusus FKIP

#### [NEW] [`supabase-fkip-complete.sql`](file:///c:/Users/Fadil/.gemini/antigravity-ide/scratch/dept.dashboard-main/supabase-fkip-complete.sql)
- Struktur tabel PostgreSQL: `lecturers`, `courses`, `academic_terms`, `term_plottings`, `course_class_plans`, dan `tutor_submissions`.
- Mengaktifkan publikasi realtime Supabase:
  ```sql
  alter publication supabase_realtime add table public.lecturers;
  alter publication supabase_realtime add table public.term_plottings;
  alter publication supabase_realtime add table public.course_class_plans;
  alter publication supabase_realtime add table public.tutor_submissions;
  ```
- Kebijakan Row Level Security (RLS) untuk keamanan multi-admin dan formulir publik.
- Data awal (*seed data*) resmi katalog FKIP (mata kuliah keguruan `MKDK4001`, `PDGK4105`, dll., dosen `FKIP001` - `FKIP008`, dan semester FKIP).

